									<div data-panel="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;PanelGroup&quot;}" id="aboutThisGame" class="game_page_autocollapse" style="max-height: 850px;">
						<div id="game_area_description" class="game_area_description">
							<h2>About This Game</h2>
							<h2 class="bb_tag" >Oh look, the truck is here.</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >A truck delivers a fresh batch of adorable creatures straight to your factory.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Unfortunately for them, they're also your main source of income.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5133900/extras/aa1b96bb030f0bc501c76c55aae7d2e1.poster.avif?t=1793308713" width=1170 height=380 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5133900/extras/aa1b96bb030f0bc501c76c55aae7d2e1.webm?t=1793308713" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5133900/extras/aa1b96bb030f0bc501c76c55aae7d2e1.mp4?t=1793308713" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >First, you need them dead.</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Grab your weapons and clear out the factory.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5133900/extras/50cdf60afc44135425221e5aade8b9c7.poster.avif?t=1793308713" width=1170 height=380 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5133900/extras/50cdf60afc44135425221e5aade8b9c7.webm?t=1793308713" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5133900/extras/50cdf60afc44135425221e5aade8b9c7.mp4?t=1793308713" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >Now turn them into something useful.</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Grab the bodies  and throw them into the crusher.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5133900/extras/989f9d0f2182340c739385317bc39658.poster.avif?t=1793308713" width=1170 height=380 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5133900/extras/989f9d0f2182340c739385317bc39658.webm?t=1793308713" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5133900/extras/989f9d0f2182340c739385317bc39658.mp4?t=1793308713" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >Get those cans into the tube.</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Your freshly processed cans still need to be sold.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5133900/extras/c8c0c3fc2fb18f48f640429b738e9957.poster.avif?t=1793308713" width=1170 height=380 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5133900/extras/c8c0c3fc2fb18f48f640429b738e9957.webm?t=1793308713" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5133900/extras/c8c0c3fc2fb18f48f640429b738e9957.mp4?t=1793308713" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >Reinvest in the business.</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Get stronger weapons. Upgrade your vacuum. Unlock machines. Build conveyors. Increase production. Bring in more creatures. Automate the factory.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5133900/extras/bf68f3947b94678e079c781f164c48bb.poster.avif?t=1793308713" width=1170 height=380 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5133900/extras/bf68f3947b94678e079c781f164c48bb.webm?t=1793308713" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5133900/extras/bf68f3947b94678e079c781f164c48bb.mp4?t=1793308713" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p>						</div>
					</div>
				
				
				
